# Troubleshooting Guide

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| User creation fails | Check UID conflicts: `cat /etc/passwd \| grep 1001` |
| SSH key not working | Verify .ssh permissions: `ls -la /home/user/.ssh` (must be 700) |
| Sudo validation fails | Test manually: `visudo -cf /etc/sudoers.d/file` |
| SSH won't restart | Check config: `sshd -t` and review `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` |
| UFW not installing | Ensure universe repo: `apt-add-repository universe` |
| Password hash errors | Verify hash format: should start with `$6$` for SHA-512 |
| Connection lost after SSH change | Open backup connection before running, test new port first |
